IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `coa-core`
IMPORT `coa4-general-duties`

-- coa4-tests-general-duties.l4: tests for coa4-general-duties.l4 (ss 170 to 181). Expected values are written from the text of the
-- section named beside each assertion, before the code was run.

-- s 170(1): the duties in ss 171 to 177 are owed by a director to the company. arguments: the person is a director; the duty
#ASSERT `s 170(1) the general duty is owed by the person to the company` TRUE `s 171 the duty to act within powers` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 170(1) the general duty is owed by the person to the company` TRUE `s 172 the duty to promote the success of the company` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 170(1) the general duty is owed by the person to the company` TRUE `s 173 the duty to exercise independent judgment` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 170(1) the general duty is owed by the person to the company` TRUE `s 174 the duty to exercise reasonable care, skill and diligence` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 170(1) the general duty is owed by the person to the company` TRUE `s 175 the duty to avoid conflicts of interest` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 170(1) the general duty is owed by the person to the company` TRUE `s 176 the duty not to accept benefits from third parties` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 170(1) the general duty is owed by the person to the company` TRUE `s 177 the duty to declare interest in proposed transaction or arrangement` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 170(1) the general duty is owed by the person to the company` TRUE `s 170(1) a duty outside sections 171 to 177` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 170(1) the general duty is owed by the person to the company` FALSE `s 171 the duty to act within powers` EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 170(2): arguments: has ceased to be a director; the duty; the matter is the exploitation of property etc learnt while a director; the matter is a thing done or omitted before ceasing
#ASSERT `s 170(2) the former director continues to be subject to the duty` TRUE `s 175 the duty to avoid conflicts of interest` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 170(2) the former director continues to be subject to the duty` TRUE `s 175 the duty to avoid conflicts of interest` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 170(2) the former director continues to be subject to the duty` TRUE `s 176 the duty not to accept benefits from third parties` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 170(2) the former director continues to be subject to the duty` TRUE `s 176 the duty not to accept benefits from third parties` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 170(2) the former director continues to be subject to the duty` TRUE `s 171 the duty to act within powers` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 170(2) the former director continues to be subject to the duty` TRUE `s 177 the duty to declare interest in proposed transaction or arrangement` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 170(2) the former director continues to be subject to the duty` FALSE `s 175 the duty to avoid conflicts of interest` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 170(3) the general duties have effect in place of the common law rules and equitable principles` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 170(3) the general duties have effect in place of the common law rules and equitable principles` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 170(4) regard shall be had to the corresponding common law rules and equitable principles` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 170(4) regard shall be had to the corresponding common law rules and equitable principles` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 170(5): arguments: s 251 shadow director; the duty is capable of applying to a shadow director
#ASSERT `s 170(5) the general duty applies to the shadow director` (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 170(5) the general duty applies to the shadow director` (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 170(5) the general duty applies to the shadow director` (JUST FALSE) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 170(5) the general duty applies to the shadow director` NOTHING TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 171: act in accordance with the constitution AND only exercise powers for the purposes conferred
#ASSERT `s 171 the director has complied with the duty to act within powers` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171 the director has complied with the duty to act within powers` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171 the director has complied with the duty to act within powers` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171 the director has complied with the duty to act within powers` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- `s 171 the director's duty to act within powers` as a regulative rule (no deadline in the text): with the event it is FULFILLED; with no event the duty stays standing.
#TRACE `s 171 the director's duty to act within powers` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director DOES `Action of a party` OF Director, Company, "act in accordance with the company's constitution and only exercise powers for the purposes for which they are conferred" AT 1
#TRACE `s 171 the director's duty to act within powers` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 172(2): the object of the duty
#ASSERT `s 172(2) the object of the duty in section 172(1)` TRUE EQUALS `s 172(2) the achievement of the company's purposes other than the benefit of its members`
#ASSERT `s 172(2) the object of the duty in section 172(1)` FALSE EQUALS `s 172(1) the success of the company for the benefit of its members as a whole`
-- s 172(1): acts in good faith as he considers AND has regard to each of (a) to (f)
#ASSERT `s 172(1) the director has complied with the duty to promote the success of the company` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 172(1) the director has complied with the duty to promote the success of the company` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 172(1) the director has complied with the duty to promote the success of the company` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 172(1) the director has complied with the duty to promote the success of the company` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 172(1) the director has complied with the duty to promote the success of the company` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 172(1) the director has complied with the duty to promote the success of the company` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 172(1) the director has complied with the duty to promote the success of the company` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 172(1) the director has complied with the duty to promote the success of the company` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 172(3) the duty has effect subject to the enactment or rule of law requiring directors to consider or act in the interests of creditors` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 172(3) the duty has effect subject to the enactment or rule of law requiring directors to consider or act in the interests of creditors` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- `s 172(1) the director's duty to promote the success of the company` as a regulative rule (no deadline in the text): with the event it is FULFILLED; with no event the duty stays standing.
#TRACE `s 172(1) the director's duty to promote the success of the company` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director DOES `Action of a party` OF Director, Company, "act in the way he considers, in good faith, would be most likely to promote the success of the company for the benefit of its members as a whole, having regard to the matters in paragraphs (a) to (f)" AT 1
#TRACE `s 172(1) the director's duty to promote the success of the company` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 173(2): arguments: in accordance with an agreement restricting future discretion; in a way authorised by the constitution
#ASSERT `s 173(2) the duty to exercise independent judgment is not infringed by the director's acting` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173(2) the duty to exercise independent judgment is not infringed by the director's acting` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173(2) the duty to exercise independent judgment is not infringed by the director's acting` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 173(1): arguments: exercises independent judgment; acts under an agreement; acts as the constitution authorises
#ASSERT `s 173(1) the director has complied with the duty to exercise independent judgment` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173(1) the director has complied with the duty to exercise independent judgment` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173(1) the director has complied with the duty to exercise independent judgment` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173(1) the director has complied with the duty to exercise independent judgment` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- `s 173(1) the director's duty to exercise independent judgment` as a regulative rule (no deadline in the text): with the event it is FULFILLED; with no event the duty stays standing.
#TRACE `s 173(1) the director's duty to exercise independent judgment` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director DOES `Action of a party` OF Director, Company, "exercise independent judgment" AT 1
#TRACE `s 173(1) the director's duty to exercise independent judgment` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 174: both the objective and the subjective standard must be met
#ASSERT `s 174(1) the director has exercised reasonable care, skill and diligence` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 174(1) the director has exercised reasonable care, skill and diligence` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 174(1) the director has exercised reasonable care, skill and diligence` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 174(1) the director has exercised reasonable care, skill and diligence` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- `s 174(1) the director's duty to exercise reasonable care, skill and diligence` as a regulative rule (no deadline in the text): with the event it is FULFILLED; with no event the duty stays standing.
#TRACE `s 174(1) the director's duty to exercise reasonable care, skill and diligence` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director DOES `Action of a party` OF Director, Company, "exercise reasonable care, skill and diligence" AT 1
#TRACE `s 174(1) the director's duty to exercise reasonable care, skill and diligence` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

#ASSERT `s 175(7) the conflict is a conflict of interest for the purposes of the section` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 175(7) the conflict is a conflict of interest for the purposes of the section` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 175(2) the situation is within the duty to avoid conflicts of interest as the exploitation of property, information or opportunity` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 175(2) the situation is within the duty to avoid conflicts of interest as the exploitation of property, information or opportunity` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 175(2) the situation is within the duty to avoid conflicts of interest as the exploitation of property, information or opportunity` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 175(3) the duty to avoid conflicts of interest applies to the conflict` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 175(3) the duty to avoid conflicts of interest applies to the conflict` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 175(5): arguments: public company; nothing in the constitution invalidates authorisation; the constitution includes provision enabling the directors; proposed to and authorised by the directors; proposed to and authorised in accordance with the constitution
#ASSERT `s 175(5) authorisation has been given by the directors` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 175(5) authorisation has been given by the directors` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 175(5) authorisation has been given by the directors` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 175(5) authorisation has been given by the directors` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 175(5) authorisation has been given by the directors` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 175(5) authorisation has been given by the directors` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 175(5) authorisation has been given by the directors` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 175(6): quorum met without the interested director AND (agreed without their voting OR would have been agreed without their votes)
#ASSERT `s 175(6) the authorisation is effective` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 175(6) the authorisation is effective` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 175(6) the authorisation is effective` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 175(6) the authorisation is effective` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 175(6) the authorisation is effective` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 175(4) the duty to avoid conflicts of interest is not infringed` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 175(4) the duty to avoid conflicts of interest is not infringed` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 175(4) the duty to avoid conflicts of interest is not infringed` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 175(1): arguments: in a situation of conflict; it arises in relation to a transaction with the company; cannot reasonably be regarded as likely to give rise to a conflict; authorised by the directors
#ASSERT `s 175(1) the director has complied with the duty to avoid conflicts of interest` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 175(1) the director has complied with the duty to avoid conflicts of interest` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 175(1) the director has complied with the duty to avoid conflicts of interest` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 175(1) the director has complied with the duty to avoid conflicts of interest` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 175(1) the director has complied with the duty to avoid conflicts of interest` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- `s 175(1) the director's duty to avoid conflicts of interest` as a regulative rule (no deadline in the text): with the event it is FULFILLED; with no event the duty stays standing.
#TRACE `s 175(1) the director's duty to avoid conflicts of interest` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director DOES `Action of a party` OF Director, Company, "avoid a situation in which he has, or can have, a direct or indirect interest that conflicts, or possibly may conflict, with the interests of the company" AT 1
#TRACE `s 175(1) the director's duty to avoid conflicts of interest` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 176(2): a third party is a person other than the company, an associated body corporate or a person acting on behalf of either
#ASSERT `s 176(2) the person is a third party` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 176(2) the person is a third party` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 176(2) the person is a third party` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 176(2) the person is a third party` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 176(3) the benefit is regarded as conferred by a third party` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 176(3) the benefit is regarded as conferred by a third party` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 176(4) the duty not to accept benefits from third parties is not infringed` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 176(4) the duty not to accept benefits from third parties is not infringed` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 176(5) the conflict is a conflict of interest for the purposes of the section` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 176(5) the conflict is a conflict of interest for the purposes of the section` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 176(1): arguments: accepts a benefit; from a third party; by reason of being a director or of anything done as director; cannot reasonably be regarded as likely to give rise to a conflict
#ASSERT `s 176(1) the director has complied with the duty not to accept benefits from third parties` FALSE (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 176(1) the director has complied with the duty not to accept benefits from third parties` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 176(1) the director has complied with the duty not to accept benefits from third parties` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 176(1) the director has complied with the duty not to accept benefits from third parties` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 176(1) the director has complied with the duty not to accept benefits from third parties` TRUE NOTHING TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 176(1) the director has complied with the duty not to accept benefits from third parties` TRUE (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 176(1) as a regulative rule: a prohibition (SHANT) with no deadline in the text. Read: with the event it is a BREACH; with no event it is not breached.
#TRACE `s 176(1) the director's duty not to accept benefits from third parties` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director DOES `Action of a party` OF Director, Company, "accept a benefit from a third party conferred by reason of his being a director or his doing (or not doing) anything as director" AT 1
#TRACE `s 176(1) the director's duty not to accept benefits from third parties` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 177(5): arguments: aware of the interest; ought reasonably to be aware of it; aware of the transaction; ought reasonably to be aware of the transaction
#ASSERT `s 177(5) the section requires a declaration so far as the director's awareness goes` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 177(5) the section requires a declaration so far as the director's awareness goes` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 177(5) the section requires a declaration so far as the director's awareness goes` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 177(5) the section requires a declaration so far as the director's awareness goes` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 177(5) the section requires a declaration so far as the director's awareness goes` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
